{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026JdXG3k9Or31793267968.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>視帝陳展鵬向來非常寵愛粉絲。近日有粉絲於社交平台發文分享一段「神奇際遇」，指自己兩年多前曾透過社交平台私訊陳展鵬，分享自己當年於中學畢業校服上手繪劇集《城寨英雄》「拳佬」與「牙佬」畫像的照片，表達多年來的支持。由於該私訊一直未被接收，該名粉絲本以為石沉大海，沒想到日前突獲陳展鵬親自接受訊息並回覆：「Yeah」，令她大感驚喜。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"be0c7f0f-4885-48c3-8903-ee32b68c6eca.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026HKd2wf1gHm1793267979.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>除了回覆該名粉絲的私訊外，陳展鵬更展現出極高的親和力。該粉絲透露，自己與朋友三年前曾無心插柳將陳展鵬加入IG群組聊天室，陳展鵬在得知後，竟主動逐一私訊該群組內的所有朋友致謝：「多謝你哋嘅支持，收到晒」，舉動非常貼心。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c367c81c-2b35-48a8-b94b-a207b06e91fe.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026WXtvBXP4x01793267979.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>對話截圖曝光後，陳展鵬親民又真誠的舉動贏得網民大讚，認為他是真心錫Fans；而該名粉絲亦興奮表示自己會永遠支持對方，高呼：「一日好鵬友，一世好鵬友！」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"0238b720-f073-4f0e-8403-047029f9e3e4.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20263IXUwduESf1793267978.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:11.184864+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.859568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:26.463603+00:00","content_hash":"ee21ef7831ff49c73eb43169650b586bad4fa7acb9c13fd002e2ddf51b2c62e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:11.184864+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}